{
  "item": "me-2nc",
  "how": "each bug planted alone in the checkout, with that file's theorems cut to `sorry` so that the guards decide, then `lake build VE.Calc.WorkExamples`; `test` lists the #guards that fail on the planted behaviour; the file restored after each. M3 is run with `hugeC` at `powChain 2`: unbounded, it would compute a value of 2.2 × 10^9 bits for the guards that show the charge missing.",
